<section id="faq" style="view-timeline:--tl-section-faq;"><div class="faq u-bg-secondary"><div class="container container--size-default"><!--[--><div class="faq__header"><h2 class="u-text-headings-large">Pirms sÄc, iespÄ“jams, vÄ“lies uzzinÄt vairÄk.</h2></div><div class="faq__body"><div class="faq-categories"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-large faq-category" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style="display:none;"><div class="u-text-headings-small details__title"></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="faq-items"><!--[--><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" open="" style="--delay:0s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Vai visos gadÄ«umos var izmantot elainerus?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>JÄ, praktiski visos gadÄ«jumos ir iespÄ“jama zobu taisnoÅ¡ana ar elaineriem. VeiksmÄ«gi var izÄrstÄ“t lÄ«dz pat 99,5 % gadÄ«jumu.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.1s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Cik ilgst ÄrstÄ“Å¡ana ar elaineriem?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Ilgums ir atkarÄ«gs no JÅ«su klÄ«niskÄ gadÄ«juma, sakarÄ ar to ir nepiecieÅ¡ama pirmreizÄ“jÄ vizÄ«te un ÄrstÄ“Å¡anas plÄns, lai precÄ«zi atbildÄ“tu uz Å¡o jautÄjumu. TaÄu ir gadÄ«jumi, kad ÄrstÄ“Å¡ana aizÅ†em 6 mÄ“neÅ¡us un pat 24 mÄ“neÅ¡us.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.2s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Cik maksÄ zobu taisnoÅ¡ana ar elaineriem?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Izmaksas ir atkarÄ«gas no katra klÄ«niskÄ gadÄ«juma sareÅ¾Ä£Ä«tÄ«bas pakÄpes. JÄrÄ“Ä·inÄs ar aptuveni 2000 EUR par vienu Å¾okli.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><details class="details details--size-small faq-item" style="--delay:0.30000000000000004s;"><summary class="details__header" style=""><div class="u-text-body-large details__title">Vai elaineri ir labÄki par breketÄ“m?</div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 36 36" class="details__marker"><path class="details__marker-line-plus" fill="currentColor" d="M16.5 5h3v24h-3V5Z"></path><path class="details__marker-line-minus" fill="currentColor" d="M30 15.5v3H6v-3h24Z"></path></svg></summary><div class="details__body"><!--[--><div class="u-wysiwyg"><div class="payload-richtext"><p>Elaineri (kapes) ir mÅ«sdienÄ«gÄkÄ zobu taisnoÅ¡anas metode.</p><p>Tie ir ne tikai mazÄk pamanÄmi apkÄrtÄ“jiem, bet arÄ« Ä“rtÄki pacientam ikdienÄ. PiemÄ“ram, tie nebojÄ mutes gÄ¼otÄdu un zobu emalju, netraucÄ“ runai, nav jÄmaina ikdienas paradumi Ä“Å¡anÄ, mutes dobuma higiÄ“nÄ un dzÄ«vesveidÄ. Ne mazÄk svarÄ«gi ir tas, ka pie Ärsta uz vizÄ«tÄ“m jÄdodas retÄk, jo pacients pats maina kapes ik pÄ“c 10â€“14 dienÄm, kÄ tas noteikts ÄrstÄ“Å¡anas plÄnÄ.</p><p><br></p><p>KlÄ«nikÄ piedÄvÄjam zobu taisnoÅ¡anu tikai ar elaineriem (kapÄ“m), izmantojot ORDOLINE taisnoÅ¡anas sistÄ“mu.</p></div></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></details><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></section>
